<title>UK: Repairs shut Russia Tuapse pipeline for three days.</title>
<headline>Repairs shut Russia Tuapse pipeline for three days.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The pipeline supplying Russian Black Sea oil terminal Tuapse will close for three days for repairs at 1200 local time on Wednesday, a reliable shipping source said.</p>
<p>Tuapse exports fuel oil, gas oil and Urals crude.</p>
<p>In the two months to the end of February the terminal exported about 85,000 barrels per day (bpd) of crude, 2,750 metric tonnes a day of fuel and 12,000 tonnes daily of gas oil.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
